{
  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-38104",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{2}$-term. So, we write it using a zero coefficient, as follows:\n\n$$\n6{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}-4x+5\n$$\n\nUsing the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{2}-6x+10 \\\\  & 2x+4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,6{x}^{3}+\\phantom{1}0{x}^{2}-\\phantom{1}4x+\\phantom{1}5\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{3}+12{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,12{x}^{2}-4x+5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,12{x}^{2}-24x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,20x+5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{20x+40}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,35\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are\n\n$\\,$ $3{x}^{2}-6x+10\\,$ and $\\,20x+5.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-38104\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>Notice that the dividend is missing the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"93\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-term. So, we write it using a zero coefficient, as follows:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"94\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-texatom><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-m